# APIs, JSON, and System Awareness

When an app uses an API, it becomes part of a bigger system.

That system includes the **app, the API, and the server** providing the data.

## External Data Integration


**External data integration** is the process of pulling live data from **outside** your app into your app.
Instead of hard-coding information, the app retrieves it when needed.

**Examples:**

<div style="display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:center; font-family:Geist, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; padding:12px 4px;">

  <div style="width:220px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius:10px; padding:16px; text-align:center;">
    <div style="font-size:1.8rem; margin-bottom:8px;">🌦️</div>
